  "body": "Set on a sunlit, corner Freehold site, this single-level weatherboard home offers a relaxed, low-maintenance lifestyle. Designed for effortless daily living, the property blends functionality with comfort in a quiet neighborhood.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen and dining area features a gas hob, a breakfast bar, and generous bench space. This light-filled central hub flows directly to an outdoor patio, creating an easy transition between indoor and outdoor spaces. The home offers three double bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and private ensuite.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include double internal access garaging and substantial storage. The corner section is fenced, creating a secure space for the family and pets.\r\n\r\nPositioned on the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, this property brings recreation to your doorstep with coastal walkways, local beaches, and the golf course just moments away. For city professionals, the Gulf Harbour Ferry Terminal is minutes from your front door, offering a comfortable commute to Downtown Auckland.\r\n\r\nCall now for more information or an appointment to view.",
